Multiplexer was designed and first prototyped in Python by Krzysztof Kulewski
at Azouk Network Ltd. in 2008. The C++ implementation and the client
libraries that this repository grew out of were written by Piotr Findeisen at
Azouk in 2008-2009. Azouk Network Ltd. released the code under the MIT
license. Since 2010 the project has been owned, maintained and developed by
Krzysztof Kulewski. See LICENSE for the copyright holders.

